  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">整合包：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">一个专注于中世纪风格的体验，仅包含少量模组，却依然保留了 Minecraft 的游玩感觉，正如我在 YouTube 频道（<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yaboysneak\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@yaboysneak</a>）中所展示的那样！如有任何问题，欢迎随时联系我，我会尽力回复。按照你的喜好自由修改，尽情享受吧！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">特色：</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">包含多种新护甲和武器的中世纪整合包</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">新增生成建筑与世界生成内容</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">更多中世纪主题的生物与小 Boss</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">中世纪方块与装饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">新挑战与更多内容！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">在服务器上游玩（点击横幅！）：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fSNEAK\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/cbfc0ef9-e5d2-4095-891f-8c898b76f012.webp\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;查看我的频道：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9k7mTzs6D7I?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>",
